            <div xml:id="m-a6af6d1b-d746-4626-aa4c-ab7e7c398715">
              <lg xml:id="m-c9dfb99d-bad1-48cd-bed8-2d70ba10ad0b">
                <l xml:id="m-8000d12e-27f4-4a11-b7ae-a81e33c2432f" facs="#m-314e35ae-28ac-4f1d-8efb-2bcede1bf559" label="text-like">The Common of Saints.</l><l xml:id="m-b6af2d1e-8817-42ed-8c8b-dc5361e99454" facs="#m-2b09a6ee-e0eb-44c7-a9f3-b04c62a6b6cb" label="text-like">On all feasts of Apostles and Evangelists, on all feasts of Saints of First</l><l xml:id="m-2744bbc4-a6de-4eb7-a221-768ac9299f31" facs="#m-2ee5c4e1-a8a9-41de-a625-8d9848b0307b" label="text-like">or Second Class, on the feast of the Dedication of a Church. and on feasts or</l><l xml:id="m-15879b33-1af6-479c-b33e-a77d37620f8a" facs="#m-a45bc90e-bae0-4595-bc5d-ca0d524af701" label="text-like">the Blessed Virgin Mary—but not during the Octaves of these feasts — the</l><l xml:id="m-ef150bbe-5d7c-4fc6-954c-fd844e73d82f" facs="#m-1a88fa22-9b4b-47a1-9c90-60c93d10bfae" label="text-like">Office is taken from the Common, except whatever is indicated in the Proper</l><l xml:id="m-9465fb04-f23a-46fe-8fbb-e452f3076103" facs="#m-2cfbf856-cc48-497c-83ac-c1ac2a3b474e" label="ambiguous">ofthe Saints.</l><l xml:id="m-b19aa5b6-86d6-44ac-8b06-e6caadbd3d39" facs="#m-66c2f508-2b7b-4afd-9f1c-666c5013128f" label="ambiguous">COMMON</l><l xml:id="m-c377168c-b7e6-4013-bc71-dc43f206406e" facs="#m-2a7ca755-7025-48de-82d8-ffceb235a30a" label="text-like">OF APOSTLES AND OF EVANGELISTS.</l><l xml:id="m-cec76055-c900-49ec-b572-e4ae89d8d9ea" facs="#m-8b04010d-ca79-47fd-becd-44ca9b3116cb" label="text-like">OUT OF PASCHAL TIME.</l><l xml:id="m-c6109541-bb7c-468d-a3ce-90566652e6c6" facs="#m-bf39cc8c-31f9-45af-8a6d-a88027cd155f" label="text-like">AT FIRST VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-772e5454-ed12-4071-8579-c24915ddec5a" facs="#m-0f33481d-e937-47ac-a65d-df1e64b460e8" label="lyrics-like">Psalms. 1. Díxit Dóminus. 8. c. p. 133.— 2. Confitébor. I. g. p. 133.—</l><l xml:id="m-877a0967-f11b-40ef-bd4c-c5a80f0e7c82" facs="#m-babbdf63-a684-4c1b-969b-fadc20e7d6cc" label="lyrics-like">3. Beátus vir. I. a 3 p. 141. — 4. Laudáte púeri. 1. f. p. 148.— 5. Laudáte</l><l xml:id="m-cccbd270-4475-475a-9297-bc78a871fade" facs="#m-5cc26a68-aab8-4b5c-8517-9dff61db695d" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum. 1. g. p. 166.</l><l xml:id="m-629d6ed7-e9a8-4c8a-a559-75edd5ab29df" facs="#m-7be058b9-c088-4b6c-bfe3-643916e16ed8" label="ambiguous">1.Ant.8</l><l xml:id="m-ae3d94bb-2878-4968-b60f-02cc15e22d62" facs="#m-1b8abf36-9040-4c91-8fc7-7a25c4e8526d" label="ambiguous">s. e</l><l xml:id="m-b839e044-49b1-4d71-a49c-fab1a7d8ddc1" facs="#m-d4318095-3c9b-4884-b998-c26151b35c26" label="lyrics-like">OC est praecéptum mé-um,</l><l xml:id="m-e3b3b627-9c94-43f0-8b8d-94d50e89fa86" facs="#m-f6d2924e-86ad-4e98-bc56-7f5f3821d925" label="lyrics-like">ut di-ligá-tis ínvi¬</l><l xml:id="m-5ec63d8e-af18-4234-8bff-fb714b1596a1" facs="#m-f5cb86db-0797-4ce0-8f99-15b4e1e400c9" label="ambiguous">2. Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-54a61ad9-86d3-4a32-ba99-ab992f5b5739" facs="#m-c856123b-4144-44a4-9e42-f1be095ad6df" label="ambiguous">1.8</l><l xml:id="m-dd132b16-39db-4d70-9833-fa7ae4aed848" facs="#m-3ffea701-722f-42cd-821c-e3d906852967" label="lyrics-like">A-jórem</l><l xml:id="m-17983708-6ebb-47a1-9c75-ebab32a306e0" facs="#m-2d14440f-d9fa-4e9b-b289-10384b225394" label="lyrics-like">cem, sic-ut di-léxi vos. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-36f9efb1-d3e7-421c-b086-e5564aec4720" facs="#m-fa97411a-04c4-41b6-bac9-9f6a5c45f08c" label="lyrics-like">ca-ri-tá-tem “ némo há¬ bet, ut ánimam sú-am pó-nat</l><l xml:id="m-3f2ff736-468e-4ff3-a564-d1097217a0b5" facs="#m-42ef024d-a348-47f9-9dff-c17dbd596477" label="ambiguous">3. Ant.4—</l><l xml:id="m-47fe224f-e4d9-4833-87a2-173ca870eac7" facs="#m-2e90d185-a2fb-4faf-a04f-d9a9c562f489" label="ambiguous">1.a3</l><l xml:id="m-ebcf8fb8-6465-4db6-b650-1c9554f357f0" facs="#m-0562900f-4a71-4e34-b446-1411fb78f34f" label="lyrics-like">Y os amíci</l><l xml:id="m-34d8046c-e9d1-40ce-9c63-05a860c5cb3f" facs="#m-16c21a51-6671-459b-a18c-e81e1948b8dc" label="lyrics-like">quis pro amí-cis sú-is. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-d19d97ef-cc63-462d-b9e6-edca974abcd5" facs="#m-88349adf-a48a-42ea-be17-7a613bbc1774" label="lyrics-like">mé-i éstis</l><l xml:id="m-0b243038-cd20-41e2-a842-6bf18ccf3c77" facs="#m-9f30c110-8b9e-445e-9e45-6d84e4b4d5a7" label="lyrics-like">si fe-cé-ri-tis quae praecípi-o vóbis, dí-cit</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>